, Claude Chabrol, relishes every malevolent, icily controlled\r\nshot of this perfectly constructed thriller, right up to its terrifying, violent climax. Adapted from Ruth Rendell's classic thriller, A Judgement in Stone, Chabrol transposes it to a remote French village. This iconic film has left a lasting mark on the cinematic landscape. Its influence transcends borders, shaping contemporary masterpieces like Bong Joon-Ho’s Parasite.\r\nCast Isabelle Huppert, Sandrine Bonnaire, Jacqueline Bisset,\r\nVirginie Ledoyen, Jean-Pierre Cassel\r\nDirector Claude Chabrol I 1995 I France / Germany I 111 mins\r\nFrench with English subtitles","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":111,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/b38e75d8-d0f6-4cbc-a46b-0faef5dea8d8.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"A Judgement in Stone (La Cérémonie)","instanceDates":"13 November-13 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/b38e75d8-d0f6-4cbc-a46b-0faef5dea8d8-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1126044AQBRKQQSRJCKHJCNVKDVKNHQDD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-13T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-13T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-13T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-13T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Drama","attribute_FilmCertificate":"15","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"French Film Festival UK","attribute_FilmGenre":"DRAMA","attribute_ForDCM":false,"attribute_IDRequired":"Proof of age ID may be requested","attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"A Judgement in Stone (La Cérémonie)","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://www.criterionchannel.com/la-ceremonie/videos/la-c