rabbit. When she follows him down a rabbit hole, events become curiouser and curiouser…As Alice journeys through Wonderland, she encounters countless strange creatures. She’s swept off her feet by the charming Knave of Hearts, who’s on the run for stealing the tarts. Confusion piles upon confusion. Then Alice wakes with a start. Was it all a daydream? \r\nChristopher Wheeldon’s Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland burst onto the stage in 2011 in an explosion of colour, stage magic and inventive, sophisticated choreography. Joby Talbot’s score combines contemporary soundworlds with sweeping melodies that gesture to ballet scores of the 19th century. Bob Crowley’s wildly imaginative, eye-popping designs draw on everything from puppetry to projections to make Wonderland wonderfully real. The result shows The Royal Ballet at its best, bringing together world-class dance with enchanting family entertainment and ingenious music and design. \r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":170,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/a29d15a9-bb9c-47a8-96e3-469449adab91.jpeg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Alice's Adventures in Wonderland - The Royal Ballet","instanceDates":"30 March-30 March","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/a29d15a9-bb9c-47a8-96e3-469449adab91-thumbnail.jpeg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1135044ASDVCRHJDNPTTBJDNHCVQDGKSH","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-30T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-30T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-03-30T19:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-03-30T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Live Screenings","attribute_ClassificationCode":"THE","attribute_DeptCode":"13 - CIN Stage on Screen","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"500547","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Performances on screen","attribute_FilmCertificate":"12A","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"Trafalgar Releasing","attribute_FilmGenre":"THEATRE","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"Alice's Adventures in Wonderland","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Stage on Screen","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"At a garden party on a sunny afternoon, Alice is surprised to see her parents’ friend Lewis Carroll transform into a white rabbit. When she follows him down a rabbit hole, events become curiouser and curiouser…As Alice journeys through Wonderland, she enc","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_VideoURL":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_CLVenue":"","attribute_IDRequired":"","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false},{"description":"All Rivers Spill Their Stories to the Sea\r\n(12A) 104min | When thousands of dead crabs wash ashore along England's North East coast, fisherman Stan Rennie finds himself leading a grassroots fight for answers and a future. \r\n\r\nStan and his family have worked this same stretch of coastline, where the river meets the sea, for centuries. He knows the tides, the weather, the jokes. But when a vast tide of poisoned crabs, lobsters and shellfish carpets miles of beach, his world is turned upside down overnight. As officials dodge responsibility and his own health declines, Stan becomes the unlikely figurehead of a campaign to uncover what really happened, uniting fellow fishermen in a David and Goliath battle that reaches all the way to the courts.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":104,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/2b9238d7-acd0-4b59-8525-d76a9dce23f6.jpg","isOnSale":false,"name":"All Rivers Spill Their Stories to the Sea","instanceDates":"21 January-21 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/2b9238d7-acd0-4b59-8525-d76a9dce23f6-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1150044AJSRCJBQBPLDTTDVPDVKTGNHRS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-21T16:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-21T16:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-21T16:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-21T16:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"525926","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Documentary","attribute_FilmCertificate":"12A","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"UK Green Film Network","attribute_FilmGenre":"DOCUMENTARY","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"All Rivers Spill - to the Sea","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=seU-YLr1SxI&t=1s","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"When thousands of dead crabs wash ashore along England's North East coast, fisherman Stan Rennie finds himself leading a grassroots fight for answers and a future.   Stan and his family have worked this same stretch of coastline, where the river meets the","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_CLVenue":"","attribute_IDRequired":""},{"description":"Andrew Lloyd Webber's Starlight Express - Live On Stage\r\n(PG) 126min TBC | Filmed live at the specially designed Starlight Auditorium at Troubadour Wembley Park Theatre, ANDREW LLOYD WEBBER'S STARLIGHT EXPRESS - LIVE ON STAGE will immerse audiences in a world of speed, song and storytelling as an incredible cast of 40 whizz across the screen, performing some of musical theatre’s most beloved songs.\r\n\r\nAs a child’s train set magically comes to life and the engines race to become the fastest in the world, Rusty the steam train has little hope of winning until he is inspired by the legend of the ‘Starlight Express’.\r\n\r\nA show seen around the world by over 30 million people, and with music by Andrew Lloyd Webber and lyrics by Richard Stilgoe, ANDREW LLOYD WEBBER'S STARLIGHT EXPRESS - LIVE ON STAGE is an electrifying experience for all ages.\r\n\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":126,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/0b336225-b412-4b57-99b8-547dd6dc372f.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Andrew Lloyd Webber's Starlight Express - Live On Stage","instanceDates":"5 December-9 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/0b336225-b412-4b57-99b8-547dd6dc372f-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1154444AJCMNHQVHLDQDVJKKNSBBGKTHR","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-05T16:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-05T16:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-09T19:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-09T19:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Live Screenings","attribute_ClassificationCode":"THE","attribute_DeptCode":"13 - CIN Stage on Screen","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Performances on screen","attribute_FilmCertificate":"PG","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"Trafalgar Releasing","attribute_FilmGenre":"THEATRE","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"Starlight Express","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OfcNrviitgI","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"Filmed live at the specially designed Starlight Auditorium at Trou