RIBUTOR":""},{"description":"Derek Vs Derek\r\n(15) 89min | The English countryside. An intensive farmer called Derek. One day his neighbor, also a Derek, forsakes tradition and starts to create a haven for nature. As tempers fray, wild animals escape and the land is transformed the film charts the pairs turbulent often funny relationship.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":89,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/2f762ae5-89e3-46dc-a8f8-2e35ae9ed37d.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Derek Vs Derek","instanceDates":"29 October-11 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/2f762ae5-89e3-46dc-a8f8-2e35ae9ed37d-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1148244AGKPCNPBRNNSQJTNKQHNKMLPQT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-29T17:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-29T17:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-11T17:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-11T17:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"521203","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Documentary","attribute_FilmCertificate":"15","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"Dartmouth Films","attribute_FilmGenre":"DOCUMENTARY","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IDRequired":"Proof of age ID may be requested","attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"Derek Vs Derek","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DZAt0mJaAQc","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"The English countryside. An intensive farmer called Derek. One day his neighbor, also a Derek, forsakes tradition and starts to create a haven for nature. As tempers fray, wild animals escape and the land is transformed the film charts the pairs turbulent","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_CLVenue":""},{"description":"[15) 127mins\r\nEnjoy 'The Greatest Christmas Film ever'.\r\nOn Christmas Eve, tough New York detective John McClane arrives in Los Angeles with the aim of reconciling with his estranged wife, Holly at the Christmas party of her employer, the Nakatomi Corporation. When the party is disrupted by a group of heavily armed criminals led by the charismatic Hans Gruber, McClane evades capture and begins a one-man war against the hostage takers who are attempting to rob the corporation whilst occupying the LAPD and the FBI by posing as terrorists. Outmanned, outgunned and ill-equipped for the task at hand, McClane calls in the help of a local beat cop in his crusade against Gruber.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":127,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/91dedbc3-42e5-4972-a3ba-f9befc19bb89.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Die Hard","instanceDates":"17 December-17 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/91dedbc3-42e5-4972-a3ba-f9befc19bb89-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"507244AHQQSQRHGNBSRJGJVGJDKDCHHHD","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-17T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-17T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-17T19:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-17T19:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4100","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"992043","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Action","attribute_FilmCertificate":"15","attribute_FILMDIS