ttribute_FACMainCategory":"L&P - Adult","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Arts & craft","attribute_ForDCM":false,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"Fused Glass Christmas Decs","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_Tutor":"Tutor: Sarah Walkley","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Adult Ed","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_FilmCertificate":"","attribute_VideoURL":"","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_IDRequired":"","attribute_FilmGenre":"","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":""},{"description":"George Michael: The Faith Tour\r\n(12A) 114min | George Michael was one of the most influential stars of his generation; his voice and songwriting defined an era. Assembled from rediscovered, previously unseen and unheard 35mm footage of his 1988 performance at the Palais Omnisports de Paris-Bercy, this new concert film captures George at the height of his creative power during the record-breaking Faith Tour. Expertly restored and remastered, the film transforms a defining cultural moment into a spectacular cinema experience. An original short film by Mary McCartney opens the feature, using newly discovered audio and imagery from 1986–1988 – the Faith era – creating a rare and intimate ‘time capsule’, offering a vivid insight into George’s mindset at this pivotal moment in his life.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":114,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/fcf452ec-9511-4bbf-8954-1e63f36d8715.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"George Michael: The Faith Tour","instanceDates":"15 November-15 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/fcf452ec-9511-4bbf-8954-1e63f36d8715-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1157044AJVKKKSNQNGMHPVSNSKHPBCSRT","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-15T16:30:00","firstInsta