n. Inspired by real events, GIANT explores with dark humour the difference between considered opinion and dangerous rhetoric offering a complicated portrait of a fiendishly charismatic icon. ","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":136,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/2d5c486e-da6b-4c2c-b6a8-38696d56edc9.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"GIANT – The Play","instanceDates":"26 November-3 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/2d5c486e-da6b-4c2c-b6a8-38696d56edc9-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1130444AKPTMKSCHLPVCHQTPBPDJMKKLB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-26T19:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-26T19:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-03T19:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-03T19:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Live Screenings","attribute_ClassificationCode":"THE","attribute_DeptCode":"13 - CIN Stage on Screen","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Performances on screen","attribute_FilmCertificate":"15","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"Trafalgar Releasing","attribute_FilmGenre":"THEATRE","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IDRequired":"Proof of age ID may be requested","attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"GIANT – The Play","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"A world-famous children’s author under threat. A battle of wills in the wake of scandal. And one chance to make amends...It’s the summer of 1983, The Witches is about to hit the shelves and Roald Dahl is making last-minute edits.  But the outcry at his re","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_VideoURL":"","attribute_Long