ribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":""},{"description":"It's A Wonderful Life\r\n(U) 130min | George Bailey is a small-town man whose life seems so desperate he wishes he had never been born.\r\nHe had always wanted to leave Bedford Falls to see the world, but circumstances and his own good heart have led him to stay. He sacrificed his education for his brother's, kept the family-run savings and loan afloat, protected the town from the avarice of the greedy banker Mr. Potter, and married his childhood sweetheart. As he prepares to jump from a bridge, his guardian angel intercedes; showing him what life would have become for the residents of Bedford Falls is he had never lived.\r\n\r\nChristmas just wouldn't be Christmas, without our traditional screening of It's A Wonderful Life!","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":130,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/fd750c5a-9abb-457d-b8aa-136710150277.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"It's A Wonderful Life","instanceDates":"24 December-24 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/fd750c5a-9abb-457d-b8aa-136710150277-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"811244AVLNVMSVBDLCVRLNLPQVVJSLGDN","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-24T15:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-24T15:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-24T15:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-24T15:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"344700","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Drama","attribute_FilmCertificate":"U","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"Park Circus Pictures","attribute_FilmGenre":"DRAMA","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"It's A Wonderful Life","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6jB4Vsi1UUM","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"George Bailey is a small-town man whose life seems so desperate he wishes he had never been born.  He had always wanted to leave Bedford Falls to see the world, but circumstances and his own good heart have led him to stay. He sacrificed his education for","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_CLVenue":"","attribute_IDRequired":""},{"description":"Cinema Rewind\r\nIt's Nice Up North +Live Q&A with Graham Fellows (AKA John Shuttleworth)\r\n(U) 79min (20006) TBC | A 20th-anniversary screening tour of Graham Fellows’ much loved comedy documentary It’s Nice Up North starring his alter ego John Shuttleworth. The tour is also being presented as a tribute to the late Martin Parr, the celebrated photographer who shot the movie, and whose distinctive eye is central to the movie’s charm and enduring appeal. \r\n\r\n‘Eccentric, beautifully inconsequential..’ Time Out\r\n\r\nIt’s Nice Up North follows the legendary comic character John Shuttleworth - on a gently absurd journey through the Shetland Islands to test the theory that the further north you go, the nicer people become. Foiled by failing light, let down by a flat car battery, and buffeted by the constant wind, John doggedly pursues his quest; asking everyone he meets the all important question; ‘Is it nice up North?’\r\nCostarring Shetland tour guide, Elma Johnson, as herself, and featuring the inspiring music of Shetland’s folk ensemble Fiddlers Bid\r\n\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":79,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/65d7d909-6fbf-473d-a566-cf55ff840b02.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"It's Nice Up North +Q&A with Gr