ter months.\r\nWith exclusive access to this exciting new show,\r\nExhibition on Screen will bring these world class\r\nworks to cinema audiences, with close examination\r\nof the art and leading experts exploring the\r\nimmense skill and influence of this master of colour\r\nand connection. Be transported back to a Parisian\r\nsummer of love through the eyes of a true visionary.\r\nAn unmissable opportunity to fall in love with Renoir\r\nthis winter.\r\nMade in close collaboration with The National Gallery, London\r\nand Musee d’Orsay, Paris.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":90,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/d1f3d308-d777-4c5c-8567-fdd669d57d1f.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Renoir & Love","instanceDates":"19 January-19 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/d1f3d308-d777-4c5c-8567-fdd669d57d1f-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1158844ANLSNBRCPBDQVCBQTKCGDLNJDV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-19T19:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-19T19:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-19T19:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-19T19:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4100","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Live Screenings","attribute_ClassificationCode":"THE","attribute_DeptCode":"13 - CIN Stage on Screen","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"511702","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Performances on screen","attribute_FilmCertificate":"PG","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"Seventh Arts","attribute_FilmGenre":"THEATRE","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"Renoir & Love","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eP653O5gvOU&t=1s","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Stage on Screen","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"Pierre-Auguste Renoir is one of the world’s favour