cal hero of legendary strength and the seductive Philistine whose beauty overpowers him returns in the Met’s larger-than-life production. Featuring a massive orchestra and chorus and some of opera’s most spellbinding tunes, this masterpiece is a feast for the eyes and ears. Giacomo Sagripanti conducts an electrifying cast led by the formidable star pairing of mezzo-soprano Aigul Akhmetshina and tenor Clay Hilley, broadcast live to cinemas worldwide.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":234,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/bd9edbdd-ca7a-4473-96dd-cf7f9ee6185e.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Samson et Dalila - The Met Opera","instanceDates":"8 December-8 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/bd9edbdd-ca7a-4473-96dd-cf7f9ee6185e-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1486AQGSMRVVCDTCCHNQTMQCGQKHVCSLB","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-08T18:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-08T18:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-08T18:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-08T18:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Live Screenings","attribute_ClassificationCode":"THE","attribute_DeptCode":"13 - CIN Stage on Screen","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"512069","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Performances on screen","attribute_FilmCertificate":"12A","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"Trafalgar Releasing","attribute_FilmGenre":"SCI-FI","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"Samson et Dalila","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"Saint-Saëns’s spectacular take on the biblical hero of legendary strength and the seductive Philistine whose beauty overpowers him returns in the Met’s larger-than-life production. Featuring a massive orchestra and chorus 