-04T18:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-05-04T17:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Live Screenings","attribute_ClassificationCode":"THE","attribute_DeptCode":"13 - CIN Stage on Screen","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"513757","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Performances on screen","attribute_FilmCertificate":"12A","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"Trafalgar Releasing","attribute_FilmGenre":"THEATRE","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"Swan Lake The Royal Ballet","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"Princess Odette is bound by a curse, turned into a swan by the evil sorcerer Von Rothbart. The spell can only be broken by a pledge of eternal love. When she meets Prince Siegfried, he is immediately enamoured by her fragile beauty and pledges to free her","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_VideoURL":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_CLVenue":"","attribute_IDRequired":"","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false},{"description":"Tenzing\r\n(PG) 126min | Based on true events, “Tenzing” chronicles the little-known story of Tenzing Norgay, a gifted Himalayan climber who, alongside New Zealand mountaineer Edmund Hillary, was the first to summit Mount Everest. Encouraged by his wife Dawa, Tenzing finds an ally in expedition secretary Jill Henderson. Together, they persuade Colonel John Hunt that Tenzing belongs on the British climbing team, rather than merely serving it. Where Western climbers see “Everest” as something to be conquered, Tenzing reveres “Chomolungma” as the sacred mother goddess. What follows is an ascent defined as much by the tensions between backgrounds, classes and competing ambitions as by the perils of the mountain itself. But high above the world, empire, rank and aspiration fall away, leaving two outsiders bound by mutual respect and trust — and for Tenzing, the fulfillment of both a lifelong dream and a spiritual calling.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":126,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/43e7da2c-b0dd-4d67-806e-ac3f0fdb98ad.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Tenzing","instanceDates":"27 October-8 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/43e7da2c-b0dd-4d67-806e-ac3f0fdb98ad-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1152644AGBTNKHPNMTCNDKPNHNQMQSDNS","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-10-27T19:30:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-10-27T19:30:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-08T16:30:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-08T16:30:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"521940","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Drama","attribute_FilmCertificate":"PG","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"A24","attribute_FilmGenre":"DRAMA","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"Tenzing","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KkYCY5YR12U","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"Based on true events, “Tenzing” chronicles the little-known story of Tenzing Norgay, a gifted Himalayan climber who, alongside New Zealand mountaineer Edmund Hillary, was the first to summit Mount Everest. Encouraged by his wife Dawa, Tenzing finds an all","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute