 to play the title role in an experimental new Broadway production of Hamlet under Gielgud’s exacting direction. But as rehearsals progress, two ages of theatre collide and the collaboration between actor and director soon threatens to unravel. From multi-award-winning writer Jack Thorne (Adolescence), this acclaimed production was filmed live during its sold-out run at the National Theatre in 2023.\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":180,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/ecec078f-c515-41b2-a86f-45efb27edbdd.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Motive and the Cue National Theatre Live","instanceDates":"18 February-25 February","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/ecec078f-c515-41b2-a86f-45efb27edbdd-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"908244ARPMMGMRVRLCVDMRMRKCVJRNKDG","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-18T19:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-18T19:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-02-25T19:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-02-25T19:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4100","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Live Screenings","attribute_ClassificationCode":"THE","attribute_DeptCode":"13 - CIN Stage on Screen","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"531375","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Performances on screen","attribute_FilmCertificate":"15","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"National Theatre Live","attribute_FilmGenre":"THEATRE","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IDRequired":"Proof of age ID may be requested","attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"The Motive and the Cue","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oxM0NT2oGx4","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"The electrifying play directed by Sam Mendes returns as Richard Burton and John Gielgud’s infamous Hamlet rehearsals play out on the big screen.  Sam Mendes (The Lehman Trilogy) directs Mark Gatiss in an Olivier Award-winning performance as John Gielgud. ","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_CLVenue":""},{"description":"The Muppet Christmas Carol \r\n(U) 89min | Includes exclusive new song iWhen Love is Gone.. | Tis the season for love, laughter and one of the most cherished stories of all time. Join Kermit the Frog, Miss Piggy and all the hilarious Muppets in this merry, magical version of Charles Dickens' classic tale.\r\n\r\nMichael Caine gives a performance that's anything but \"bah, humbug!\" as greedy, penny-pinching Ebenezer Scrooge. One fateful Christmas Eve, Scrooge is visited by the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present and Future. Together with kind, humble Bob Cratchit (Kermit the Frog) and his family, these Spirits open Scrooge's eyes --- and his heart --- to the true meaning of Christmas.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":89,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/6bcfaafd-2bd0-439e-8628-b80de9a06589.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"The Muppet Christmas Carol","instanceDates":"19 December-19 December","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/6bcfaafd-2bd0-439e-8628-b80de9a06589-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"812444AQQDGTQKLVQBLRTBVRMHNMLMQVQ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-19T11:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-19T11:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-12-19T11:45:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-12-19T11:45:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4100","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_EDIFilmN