FilmNumber":"","attribute_IDRequired":"","attribute_FilmGenre":"","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":""},{"description":"Three Friends (Trois Amies)\r\nFrench Film Festival UK 2026\r\n(15) 118min (2024) | Friendship is at a premium in this engaging chamber piece set in Lyon from director Emmanuel Mouret. \r\n \r\nIn their quest for fulfilment three forty-something friends embody different views on romance. Joan )India Hair) is ready to give up on her marriage after the passion has faded. She confides in Alice (Camille Cottin) who counters that her own marriage is better off without fervour, believing “synchronised love is rare.” To avoid the drama off heartache, she’s content with mere affection. Meanwhile, their unmarried friend Rebecca (Sara Forestier) is secretly having an affair with Alice’s husband and hoping for a deeper commitment. \r\n \r\nCast Camille Cottin, Sara Forestier, India Hair, Gregoire Ludig, Damien Bonnard, Vincent Macaigne, Eric Caravaca\r\n \r\nDirector Emmanuel Mouret I France I 2024 I 118 mins I French Language with English Subtitles\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":118,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/c737923a-78be-4c79-8a26-d716f6df3240.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Three Friends (Trois Amies)","instanceDates":"24 November-24 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/c737923a-78be-4c79-8a26-d716f6df3240-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1147444AJVHJQLCGHCPBTCKPJGSKJKJGJ","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-24T19:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-24T19:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-24T19:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-24T19:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","att