Category":"Poetry","attribute_ForDCM":false,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"VERBALISE","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Literature","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_FilmCertificate":"","attribute_VideoURL":"","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_CLVenue":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_IDRequired":"","attribute_FilmGenre":"","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false},{"description":"Warren Miller's Days Off\r\n(12A) 77min TBC | This winter, drop in on Warren Miller’s 77th film, Days Off. Follow host Katie Burrell as the world’s best athletes show you what they do on their days off—no agenda, no competition, just pure, unscripted joy.\r\nEmbark on a global journey from heli-drops in Alaska and high-alpine mountaineering in Chamonix to the legendary powder of Hokkaido, Japan. Take a ride down Banff’s infamous skijoring course, hit the slopes of Deer Valley, and charge Canada’s finest in Revelstoke, Whistler, and Pemberton. Days Off captures the raw, unfiltered heart of mountain culture—a pure celebration of skiing for skiing’s sake and the joy of making time for what matters most.\r\nWinter’s greatest tradition is back.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":77,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/d77860a7-cd6e-4300-b6f8-f38962e5cd10.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Warren Miller's Days Off","instanceDates":"27 January-27 January","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/d77860a7-cd6e-4300-b6f8-f38962e5cd10-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1158044ATVMJVJMDRCJMTRPCMCVBKVBGN","firstInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-27T19:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-27T19:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2027-01-27T19:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2027-01-27T19:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4100","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Documentary","attribute_FilmCertificate":"12A","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"-","attribute_FilmGenre":"DOCUMENTARY","attribute_ForDCM":false,"attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"Warren Miller's Days Off","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://vimeo.com/1225322843?fl=pl&fe=ti","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"This winter, drop in on Warren Miller’s 77th film, Days Off. Follow host Katie Burrell as the world’s best athletes show you what they do on their days off—no agenda, no competition, just pure, unscripted joy. Embark on a global journey from heli-drops in","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_CLVenue":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"","attribute_IDRequired":""},{"description":"We, The Hated +Live Director Q&A with Rich Felgate\r\n(15) 89min | Told through the lives and motivations of those on the frontline, We, the Hated turns its camera on the people behind one of the most polarising protest movements in recent memory. What emerges goes deeper than placards and road blocks: these are individuals who have weighed up the personal consequences of action against the existential stakes of inaction. With fossil fuels driving both the climate crisis and global conflict, and governments increasingly cracking down on dissent, the film raises urgent questions about protest, power and what democracy actually means in practice. Director Rich Felgate, who is in a relationship with one of Just Stop Oil's co-founders, brings an insider closeness to the story whilst retaining enough balance to speak to audiences well beyond the already converted.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":89,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/5e096096-916d-405c-a502-ca72d57e14af.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"We, The Hated","instanceDates":"25 November-25 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/5e096096-916d-405c-a502-ca72d57e14af-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1150444AHRJTTHQCMVLJLQBRMHVRHMNHV","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-25T19:15:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-25T19:15:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-25T19:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-25T19:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Documentary","attribute_FilmCertificate":"15","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"-","attribute_FilmGenre":"DOCUMENTARY","attribute_ForDCM":false,"attribute_IDRequired":"Proof of age ID may be requested","attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"We, The Hated","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://vimeo.com/876554242","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"Told through the lives and motivations of those on the frontline, We, the Hated turns its camera on the people behind one of the most polarising protest movements in recent memory. What emerges goes deeper than placards and road blocks: these are individu","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_CLVenue":"","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":""},{"description":"Whalefall\r\n(15) 106min | WHALEFALL follows a scuba diver in search of his deceased father's remains who gets swallowed by an 80-foot, 60-ton sperm whale and has only one hour to escape before his oxygen runs out. After giving up on life, the young man is surprised to find a reason to live in the most dangerous and unlikely of places.\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":106,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/fa04a1e8-15b7-4479-bb7f-c647caa2850b.jpg","isOnSale":false,"name":"Whalefall","instanceDates":"13 November-13 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/fa04a1e8-15b7-4479-bb7f-c647caa2850b-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1149044AKTRLLNNHJJLPMMKDTHQMVVHST","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-13T17:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-13T17:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-13T17:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-13T17:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"10 - CIN Mainstream","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"471667","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Family","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Action","attribute_FilmCertificate":"15","attribute_FILMDISTRIBUTOR":"Walt Disney Pictures","attribute_FilmGenre":"ACTION","attribute_ForDCM":true,"attribute_IDRequired":"Proof of age ID may be requested","attribute_IncludedInX6GroupBookingOffer":false,"attribute_ShortName":"Whalefall","attribute_ThirdPartyListings":false,"attribute_VideoURL":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dw-5ZGapGTQ","attribute_WebsiteCategory":"Cinema","attribute_WebsiteCopy":"WHALEFALL follows a scuba diver in search of his deceased father's remains who gets swallowed by an 80-foot, 60-ton sperm whale and has only one hour to escape before his oxygen runs out. After giving up on life, the young man is surprised to find a reaso","attribute_EventInfo":"","attribute_ConfirmationText":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine1":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine2":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine3":"","attribute_Tutor":"","attribute_LongEventNameLine4":"","attribute_CLVenue":""},{"description":"Whispers In The Woods\r\n(U) 90min | Delving deep into the woodland realms, where lynxes, bears, deer, owls, capercaillies, and other river creatures roam, wildlife photographer and filmmaker Vincent Munier (The Velvet Queen) not only seeks to pay tribute once again to the visual splendour of nature but also to capture the forest’s poetic sounds. The whispers of the woods are echoing the whispers passed from Munier’s father to himself, and now to his own son. This becomes a heartfelt declaration of Munier’s love for his father, intertwining familial bonds with the untamed beauty of the natural world.","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":90,"imageUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/4a44c8fd-4864-4acf-858c-faa7435c5b12.jpg","isOnSale":true,"name":"Whispers In The Woods","instanceDates":"6 November-11 November","thumbnailUrl":"https://system.spektrix.com/breweryarts/files/4a44c8fd-4864-4acf-858c-faa7435c5b12-thumbnail.jpg","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"1128644ALNTBCPMNPGBKKSTJGHPLHVMJC","firstInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-06T19:45:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-06T19:45:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2026-11-11T13:15:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2026-11-11T13:15:00Z","altText":"","attribute_AccountCode":"4000 Ticket Sales","attribute_AreWeTheTicketAgent":false,"attribute_BreweryMember48hPriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Classification":"Cinema","attribute_ClassificationCode":"CIN","attribute_DeptCode":"12 - CIN Specialist","attribute_EDIFilmNumber":"463860","attribute_FACMainCategory":"Film","attribute_FACSecondaryCategory":"Documentary"